          <h1>Arwa Naalwala, CPA</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">A cross-border CPA who has lived it herself.</p>
          <p>Arwa is a CPA licensed in both Michigan and Ontario, with more than ten years of experience in public accounting and corporate roles. She works with individuals, families, small businesses and corporations on both sides of the border.</p>
          <p>She has lived and worked in both the U.S. and Canada, so she knows first-hand what it&rsquo;s like to deal with two tax systems at once: the forms nobody warned you about, the deadlines that don&rsquo;t line up, and the nagging worry that you&rsquo;ve missed something.</p>
          <p>That&rsquo;s why her approach is personal rather than transactional. She takes the time to understand your situation, your goals, and what matters to your family or business before recommending a path forward.</p>
